  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/IWS/BH_NU_HEADER.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1126\" height=\"378\"><br><br><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong>本整合包已弃用，请使用普通的 IWS 以获取 Fabric 的最新版本</strong></span><br><br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fNINJA79\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/IWS/BH_NU_PROMO.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1126\" height=\"247\"></a><br><br><br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/IWS/BH_NU_BANNER1.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1126\" height=\"111\"><br><br><br><span style=\"font-size:36px\">Immersed With Shaders 是一个完全客户端的整合包，包含提升 FPS 的模组、简单实用的生活便利性模组以及增强的原版自然音效。<br></span><br><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/sZkeWOf8A04?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:24px\">Forge 版本可<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/immersed-with-shaders\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">在此处</a>获取</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:24px\">点击下方加入我的 Discord！</span><br><br><a href=\"https://discord.gg/Ky9JCDAseb\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/IWS/BH_NU_BANNER3.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1126\" height=\"112\"></a><br><br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/IWS/BH_NU_BANNER2.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1126\" height=\"111\"><br><br><span style=\"font-size:24px\">✅兼容原版服务器</span><br><span style=\"font-size:24px\">✅内置光影</span><br><span style=\"font-size:24px\">✅完全客户端运行</span><br><span style=\"font-size:24px\">✅支持所有 PC 配置</span><br><span style=\"font-size:24px\">✅大幅提升帧率</span><br><span style=\"font-size:24px\">✅支持 1.18 (v1)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:24px\">✅支持 1.19 (v2)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:24px\">✅增强音效</span><br><span style=\"font-size:24px\">✅易于使用</span><br><span style=\"font-size:24px\">✅Journey Map（按 J 键）</span><br><span style=\"font-size:24px\">✅自定义音乐模组</span><br><span style=\"font-size:24px\">✅可配置的缩放功能</span><br><span style=\"font-size:24px\">✅增强动画</span><br><strong><span style=\"font-size:24px\">无需 Optifine！</span><br></strong><br><br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/IWS/BH_NU_BANNER4.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1126\" height=\"112\"><br><br><span style=\"font-size:36px\">要启用光影，请前往暂停菜单 &gt; 视频设置 &gt; 光影包 &gt; 选择现有的光影并点击应用。控制设置中也提供了切换光影的按钮。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong>自定义你的光影！</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:36px\">Complementary 光影指南：</span><strong><br></strong><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/iO7ZFqbGMp0?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:36px\">Sildurs Vibrant Shaders 中等画质指南：</span><br><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/eLrRaxBd39c?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><br><span style=\"font-size:36px\">Sildurs Enhanced Default 指南：</span><br><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/fquZ9-89LlA?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">我不拥有这些模组或光影的所有权，所有荣誉归模组作者和光影作者所有。<br></span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">- Complementary Shaders v4 (EminGTR)<br></span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">- Sildurs Shaders (SildurFX)</span></p>",
